     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "Sound",
     "md": "Sound is stored by **sampling**: measuring the wave many times per second (**sample rate**, Hz) using a number of bits (**bit depth**). File size (bits) = sample rate x bit depth x seconds x channels."
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "pieges",
